WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.470
<b>Goddess Search, Day 4</b>

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:08.620
<i>I was told to press her for information, but...</i>

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.590
<i>I can't trust her.</i>

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:12.730
Well, I'll be leaving now.

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:13.220
Huh?

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:17.160
Tell Elsie to come see me
 when she gets back.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.030
Hey, wait!

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:18.990
Buh-bye!

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:23.500
What is this?!

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.310
Is it Kanon?!

00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:07.830
<i>Where's Shiori?</i>

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:16.430
<b>Shiori</b>

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:18.780
<i>This notebook is...</i>

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:23.250
<i>Shiori?</i>

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.550
<i>Is she giving me permission to read it?</i>

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:29.660
<i>Just look at how much she's scrapped...</i>

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.760
<i>I'm not allowed to read those, huh?</i>

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:44.580
<i>"On the eve of the French revolution,</i>

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:47.500
<i>oppressive nobles, wars, and 
poverty ravaged the countryside,</i>

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.110
<i>causing the people much suffering.</i>

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:55.060
<i>I, Simone, have inherited the 
Mask of Justice my late father protected!</i>

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:57.620
<i>I am the swordswoman who upholds justice!</i>

00:02:57.980 --> 00:02:59.660
<i>Étoile de Shooting Star!"</i>

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:02.490
<i>What happened to the SF setting?</i>

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.540
<i>And this is horrible. Awful, even.</i>

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:15.210
It's really interesting! Can I read the 
continuation if I come back tomorrow?

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:32.100
Please read the rest of my story.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:34.860
<i>I guess I made the right choice.</i>

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:41.560
But it's really hard to not
 criticize that story...

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:44.060
Huh?

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:45.240
Why did it suddenly get dark?

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:46.970
Is it closing time already?

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:52.120
Whatever.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:53.780
Next will be Ayumi or Chihiro...

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:17.650
The miasma is getting stronger!

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:20.090
Her defenses are wearing down.

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:22.740
Hang in there, Kanon!

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:25.250
What's with this disgusting miasma?

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:26.900
Nora?! Didn't you leave?!

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:31.120
You thought I wouldn't notice
 miasma seeping into the hallway?

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:33.790
What's going on?

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.120
I want an explanation.

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:42.380
Come on, spit it out.

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.890
Vintage put a curse on her.

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:50.760
The fate of New Hell

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:53.420
rests on whether she lives or dies.

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:57.500
<i>Only a demon could do this.</i>

00:04:58.220 --> 00:05:00.740
<i>Is it one of the demons who stabbed Kanon?</i>

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:06.720
<i>Vintage?!</i>

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:07.490
<i>No...</i>

00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:23.730
<i>They're not trying to kill me?</i>

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.020
<i>Then I'll make my move!</i>

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:29.550
<i>There is someone capable of 
doing this who isn't a demon!</i>

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:34.720
<i>Luna! Tsukiyo's doll!</i>

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:36.190
<i>Is she a goddess?</i>

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:39.560
Stay away from Tsukiyo.

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.400
I'm being crushed!

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:51.400
<i>There's a goddess inside Tsukiyo!</i>

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:53.830
<i>But there may be enemies around.</i>

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:56.170
<i>I have to pretend that I know nothing.</i>

00:05:57.380 --> 00:05:58.920
Is this some kind of prank?!

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:01.540
Why are you picking on me?!

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:04.670
I am Vulcanus,

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:07.930
a goddess who values justice and intricacy.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:09.510
<i>Vulcanus!</i>

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:11.430
<i>She's one of the sisters Diana mentioned!</i>

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:13.520
<i>But why is she revealing her name?!</i>

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:14.930
<i>Doesn't she understand the situation?!</i>

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:17.540
This is a warning.

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:19.560
Never go near Tsukiyo again.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:21.860
Tsukiyo is a beautiful girl.

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:24.610
More beautiful than anything
 I have ever seen.

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:30.170
I will not allow an unfaithful, dirty, and 
dangerous man like you to associate with her.

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:31.530
Which of us is the dangerous one?!

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:32.870
What have I done?!

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:36.040
You were being quite 
friendly with the library girl.

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:38.660
I saw you with my own eyes.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:41.320
<i>She's pretty observant, for a doll.</i>

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.670
<i>Was Tsukiyo watching through Luna?</i>

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.800
<i>If that's the case, I can't let 
them see Shiori's letter.</i>

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.680
<i>Goodbye, evidence!</i>

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:59.890
I was aware that you received
 something from that girl.

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:02.900
This is the undeniable proof.

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.400
<b>Tofu and vegetable chowder</b>

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:05.820
What's this?

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:07.590
He's gone!

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:08.360
Hey!

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:09.860
You better clean up the mess you made!

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:20.000
<i>Clearly she's still just a doll, 
if she fell for that trick.</i>

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:22.550
<i>But she made a mess in the process.</i>

00:07:22.550 --> 00:07:24.770
<i>What if Vintage finds her?</i>

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:27.460
<i>If I want to stop Vulcanus...</i>

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.150
<i>She's not here!</i>

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:33.220
<i>That means...</i>

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:44.930
<i>Tsukiyo...</i>

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:47.190
<i>No, there's a ring.</i>

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:50.310
I am a weak goddess.

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:53.140
My vision and hearing are poor.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:54.200
I cannot walk.

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:57.200
However, I can manipulate objects.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.760
I send my soul into objects,

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:02.600
turning them into my eyes and limbs.

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:04.250
Objects are all I need

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:06.790
to protect Tsukiyo.

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:13.720
Let me talk to Tsukiyo!

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:15.530
Tsukiyo!

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:23.850
I feel the same way Luna does.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:27.290
You never came to see me.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:29.360
<i>Right...</i>

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:30.860
<i>Since she hosts a goddess,</i>

00:08:31.290 --> 00:08:33.860
<i>Tsukiyo remembers everything
 from her conquest.</i>

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:36.820
<i>No wonder she's mad.</i>

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:38.370
On top of that,

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:43.230
you're spending lots of time with
 the singer girl and the library girl.

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:46.090
You mean nothing to me!

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:46.960
I hate you!

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:49.730
Luna, get rid of him!

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:55.630
Hey, come on!

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.410
You creepy doll!

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:59.150
Let me through!

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:01.020
I want to talk to Tsukiyo!

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:06.050
Tsukiyo says that she
 doesn't want to see you.

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:09.350
If you wish to speak to her,
 you'll have to get past me.

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:10.910
<i>Tsukiyo refuses to come out.</i>

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:13.020
<i>It sounds like she doesn't want
 to hear what I have to say.</i>

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:14.110
<i>In that case...</i>

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:16.250
I'm the one who should be mad!

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:18.880
Why are you doing this to me?!

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:22.370
Why? You know why!

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:24.690
You were unfaithful to her 
with that singer Kanon,

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:28.020
then you had the audacity to make 
a move on the library girl, too!

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:29.300
<i>Don't get so close.</i>

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:30.880
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:32.840
You must be confused.

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:38.280
Liars like you get buried by benches, 
crushed into paste,

00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:40.350
and sent to the depths of hell!

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:41.680
<i>That's not very beautiful.</i>

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:43.550
<i>Aren't you Tsukiyo's partner?</i>

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:46.730
<i>But I can't let this event end quietly.</i>

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:49.840
<i>Bad situations are important steps in a conquest.</i>

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:51.320
<i>This is where I must make my move.</i>

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:55.610
Don't you trust me, Tsukiyo?

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:59.620
How could she trust you, demon?

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:01.350
Leave at once!

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:02.030
I refuse!

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:05.160
I won't leave until I've talked with Tsukiyo!

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:13.210
I was happy being alone.

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:18.300
So why did this evil man have to...

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.870
I'm ashamed of myself...

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:22.810
It was inevitable.

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:24.450
Inevitable?!

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:26.310
How can you say such an irresponsible thing—

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:30.010
It really was inevitable...

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:34.860
We were brought together by fate.

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:40.170
How can you say it was fate?

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.890
You're the one who approached me first!

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:45.440
Why did you come back?

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:46.370
Why...

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:49.250
I was so close to forgetting about you...

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:51.320
Tsukiyo!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.750
Kiss me!

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:56.380
Huh?

00:10:56.690 --> 00:10:59.380
A kiss will solve all of our problems!

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:00.280
What?

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:02.260
In the end, it comes down to the kiss!

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:07.210
Glory for all dating sims!

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:11.190
You can no longer move now.

00:11:11.590 --> 00:11:12.540
Shed!

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:19.630
Your presence will corrupt Tsukiyo.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:22.530
I will not let you see Tsukiyo again.

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:27.330
You should hurt me more than that.

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:29.420
You're absolutely right.

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:31.330
I've hurt Tsukiyo.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:34.410
And I can't guarantee that
 I won't make her unhappy.

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:37.300
How dare you speak so indifferently?!

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:41.540
Leave before I drop these on you.

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:44.550
I'm willing to accept any punishment.

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:49.060
I need you to love me for a little longer!

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:51.350
Otherwise,

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:53.470
I won't be able to protect you!

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:55.890
Nonsense.

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:57.410
Luna! Stop!

00:11:57.410 --> 00:11:58.360
Tsukiyo?

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:00.360
Can I trust you?

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:03.480
Can I really trust you, Keima?

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:07.370
This world is filled with beautiful things.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:12.300
We can search for them!

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:14.100
You and I, together!

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:24.720
Keima!

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:29.640
Luna, are you trying to kill Keima?

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:32.640
I lost control because you interfered.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:35.280
This man doesn't know when to give up.

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:40.710
Luna, we should talk to
 Keima about your sisters.

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:43.850
He cannot know about my existence.

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:46.820
How can you say that after everything you did?

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:49.910
Do you really trust this man?

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:54.430
<i>I need you to love me for a little longer!</i>

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:56.300
<i>Otherwise,</i>

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:58.510
<i>I won't be able to protect you!</i>

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:12.810
Tsukiyo!

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:19.440
Tsukiyo!

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:31.100
A Vintage curse, huh?

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:33.910
So why did they target this girl?

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.870
I can't say right now.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:40.870
If you wait too long,
 they'll restore Ancient Hell.

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:44.050
The Loose Souls team won't let that happen.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:49.140
You think the Loose Souls
 team works for good?

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:50.270
What do you mean?

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:51.840
Have you heard the rumors about

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:55.560
Vintage worming their way
 into the Loose Souls team?

00:13:56.570 --> 00:13:58.950
Vintage is within the Loose Souls team?!

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:02.880
The order to search for the goddesses

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:05.990
is essentially an order to
 capture the goddesses.

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:09.570
I wonder who issued the order.

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:13.860
Capture the goddesses?

00:14:14.530 --> 00:14:16.370
Know your place.

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:19.460
Wh-What is this doll?

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:23.480
Apollo is inside this girl.

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:29.460
Are we all living inside
 human girls right now?

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:31.070
Wait, is this...

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:32.660
Yes, a goddess.

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:33.720
Katsuragi...

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:34.470
A goddess?

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.030
You said you were Vulcanus, right?

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:40.240
Vulcanus...

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:42.750
The third goddess...

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:50.550
Who are you?

00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:53.170
I am Diana.

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:55.200
It's been so long, Dear Sister.

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:57.200
Ah...

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.950
Our appearances may have changed,

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:01.990
but I am overjoyed to see you again.

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:04.870
It appears that the time has
 come for us to be reunited.

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.210
Let us join our powers together.

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:09.990
By the way, Dear Sister...

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:11.720
What are those things on your back?

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:12.680
On my back?

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:14.810
You mean my wings?

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:15.970
What about them?

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:18.980
N-No, it's nothing.

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:23.880
However, I still find it hard to believe
 that we are being targeted.

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:25.550
To leave Apollo in such a state...

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:29.950
Right, I need the two of you
 to remove Apollo's curse.

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:31.530
I need you to come upstairs.

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:33.720
I cannot move.

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:35.200
Carry me.

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:37.290
You could turn back into 
Tsukiyo and walk yourself.

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:38.550
I don't see a problem.

00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:40.240
You've carried Tsukiyo around before.

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:41.830
This is getting interesting.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.000
Katsuragi.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:43.500
Hmm?

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:46.300
My dear sister has her wings back.

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:48.010
What?

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:49.790
I only have my ring.

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:52.220
This means that my dear sister
 has recovered more power.

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:55.420
Did you engage in a special 
act of love with her?

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:56.280
Huh?

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:57.720
One that you didn't do with Tenri!

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.390
I didn't do anything.

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:02.660
Now, enough of that hushed chatter.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.460
Diana may be my sister,

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:07.230
but you should not speak 
so freely to other women.

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:12.240
Since you are an important source
 of power for Tsukiyo and myself.

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:14.740
Speaking of which, Diana...

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:17.990
How did you recover your power?

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:20.120
Well, a lot has happened.

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:22.220
We can talk about this later.

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:23.620
There's more important business
 to take care of right now!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.630
Get a move on!

00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:33.010
It pains me to see her like this.

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:36.590
I wasn't able to remove
 the curse by myself.

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:42.520
We will join our powers to
 remove the Weiss curse.

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:58.030
<i>Their power has been combined...</i>

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:00.140
<i>Incredible! This should be enough...</i>

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:10.820
It's out!

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:14.550
Kanon! Are you okay?!

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:18.970
Kanon?

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:27.550
Hey, she's not waking up!

00:17:27.550 --> 00:17:28.400
What's wrong?!

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:30.900
This is very bad. 
She's taken a dive.

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:32.290
A dive?

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:33.510
Hydration.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:35.630
It's one of Sister Apollo's defensive measures.

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:39.030
She altered the body's state
 and dove deep inside.

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:41.750
However, this merely buys time.

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.910
She must have been desperate.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:46.070
I don't need the commentary!

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:47.240
Get to the point!

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:49.370
Our spell succeeded.

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:50.920
The curse is gone.

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:55.050
However, Apollo also cast a spell on herself.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.750
We will not be able to remove this spell.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:02.440
We need Sister Apollo to
 recover her power...

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:07.680
It's also possible that Mercurius 
would know what to do.

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:10.070
Ah, Mercurius...

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:11.690
But we don't know where she is.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:15.320
Don't turn this into a crappy RPG!

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:13.680
<b>I saw Mercurius in Westtown.</b>

00:18:13.680 --> 00:18:15.180
<b>You must pass through the 
Valley of Dragons to reach Westtown.</b>

00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:16.590
<b>It's possible if you have an airship...</b>

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:17.200
You try going on this wild goose chase!

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:25.700
Well, at least we don't have to
 worry about Kanon dying now.

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:29.660
I didn't expect to find a goddess so soon.

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:32.890
If I report this to the bureau chief,
 I'll get more than just a medal!

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:33.420
Nora!

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:35.050
Are you interested in working with me?

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:36.230
Huh?

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:39.930
Can you hide this information from
 your superiors for one week?

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:41.240
What? Why?

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:42.940
I'm not asking you to do it for free.

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:42.300
Hey!

00:18:42.940 --> 00:18:46.770
Once New Hell is saved,
 you can take all of the credit.

00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:50.060
I'm willing to hear you out.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:58.730
Huh?

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:00.240
The door's open.

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:02.130
Is anyone in here?

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:05.370
What are you doing, Haqua?

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.400
What's wrong?

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:09.010
Where's Nora?

00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:12.060
She left. We have a deal.

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:13.430
U-Um...

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:15.330
Sorry!

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.380
I haven't been any help at all.

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:19.760
That's not true.

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:23.010
Why did you ask Nora to join you, then?

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:24.670
I didn't have a choice.

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:26.620
We need information right now.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:31.020
I felt so proud when I was
 assigned to be a section chief.

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.270
But now...

00:19:32.510 --> 00:19:34.330
<i>Have you heard the rumors about</i>

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:37.570
<i>Vintage worming their way
 into the Loose Souls team?</i>

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:41.190
That's just something Nora said.

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:44.720
You shouldn't believe everything you hear.

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:46.350
You have your own important job to do.

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:47.400
Okay, all done.

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:48.870
Clearly say it to me!

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:51.340
Tell me how you feel!

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:52.880
Say that you need me!

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:56.590
Diana?

00:19:57.810 --> 00:20:04.000
Katsuragi, could you please kiss me?

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.010
Wh-What?

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.480
Di-Diana?

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:17.190
Hey...

00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:21.350
I can't do this after all!

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:24.490
Stay away from me, you animal!

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:26.120
This is too hard for me!

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:28.710
The hell are you trying to do?!

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:30.910
Is it my fault?

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:31.820
What?

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:35.420
Sister Vulcanus has recovered her wings.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:36.830
That cannot be right!

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:38.400
A goddess's power comes from love!

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:42.120
My dear sister's host cannot
 have more love than Tenri!

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:43.130
That would be

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:45.590
unfathomable!

00:20:45.940 --> 00:20:48.300
But the facts say differently...

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.680
That's impossible, you insensitive clod!

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:55.750
Tenri has loved you for ten years!

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.920
It must be my fault.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.120
It's...

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:01.350
because I think of you as

00:21:01.350 --> 00:21:04.780
a sleazy creep who chases
 skirts like a crazed man...

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:07.290
What exactly is this development?

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:11.010
I've realized my mistake.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:14.740
I will do my best to like you...

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:17.390
So you must engage in the ritual
 of love with Tenri right away!

00:21:17.390 --> 00:21:19.170
Wait, wait, wait...

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:22.090
Haqua?!

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:24.170
This doesn't seem quite right.

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:26.910
Do not interrupt our conversation!

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:28.170
Right back at you.

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:29.770
I was here first.

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:32.020
What were you talking about in this room?

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:32.720
Huh?

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:34.740
N-Nothing important!

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:36.320
Then you should leave!

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:38.130
I didn't choose to...

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:40.110
This is so stupid.

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:42.360
A goddess is above quarreling.

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:44.110
Diana.

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:49.120
It's my fault that you haven't
 recovered your power.

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:53.120
I realize that you and Tenri have
 it harder than the other girls.

00:21:53.840 --> 00:21:56.580
Because both of you know
 everything that is going on.

00:21:57.010 --> 00:21:58.380
I'm sorry.

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:04.630
No, I am the one who asked you to do this.

00:22:05.270 --> 00:22:09.130
I do not feel as much 
disgust towards you now.

00:22:09.130 --> 00:22:11.380
I believe that you are a dependable person.

00:22:14.930 --> 00:22:18.310
D-Do your best, Keima.

00:22:22.440 --> 00:22:25.230
He didn't need to apologize...

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:20.430
<b>Punch and Date</b>

00:24:05.680 --> 00:24:08.270
Three goddesses are left. 
The conquests are almost going too well.

00:24:08.270 --> 00:24:10.980
But the next target is Yui, 
the target I have the most trouble with.

00:24:10.980 --> 00:24:14.220
Katsuragi, how about you get rid of that scary 
look on your face and go on a date with me?

00:24:14.220 --> 00:24:15.220
Sure, I'll go on a date.

00:24:15.220 --> 00:24:16.620
But I'm doing this to bring out the goddess!

00:24:16.620 --> 00:24:18.400
I'm not doing this for Yui!

00:24:18.400 --> 00:24:19.860
Why are you going tsundere?
